            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.5.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Akorintho 5:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambi kpwa utu wani anjina anaamula afuasi ayawao? Na kpwa utu wani anjina nao anaabera afuasi ayawao? Mmanye kukala, siku mwenga swiswi hosi hundaima mbere za Mlungu huamulwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.45.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isaya 45:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kahi za Maandiko Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo, ni lazima huriche kuamula ayawehu, wala husihende chochosi ndichohenda ayawehu adzikpwale au ainjire dambini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa sababu ya Bwana Jesu namanya kpwa kpweli takuna chakurya chochosi ambacho ni haramu. Ela mutu achiona chakurya fulani ni haramu, phahi chakurya hicho kpwakpwe chindakala haramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi uchimkosera myao kpwa sababu ya chakurya uryacho, kpwa kpweli undakala ukaricha kummendza. Usikubali hata chidide chakurya chikale sababu ya kubananga kuluphiro ra mutu wanjina ambaye Jesu wamfwerera! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi usihende chitucho chinono chionekane chii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana ufalume wa Mlungu siyo kurya chitu fulani au kunwa chitu fulani, ela ni kuhenda haki, kukala na amani, na kuphokera raha. Na higa gosi garehwa ni Roho Mtakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye amuhumikiraye Jesu hivyo, anamuhamira Mlungu, tsona andakubaliwa ni atu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi chila wakati nahudinisireni kuhenda mambo garehago amani na ambago ganaterya kuphezana chiroho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usibanange kazi ya Mlungu kpwa sababu ya chakurya. Vyakurya vyosi vya kuriwa ni halali, ela ni makosa sana mutu kumuhenda myawe ainjire dambini kpwa sababu ya chira aryacho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baha usirye nyama, ama kunwa uchi, ama kuhenda chochosi ambacho chindamuhenda myao ahende dambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu akuluphiravyo kuhusu maneno higa, phahi nagakale gakpwe na Mlunguwe bahi. Waajaliwa mutu ambaye kadzisikira kuhenda makosa ahendapho dzambo aonaro ni ra haki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ndiyekala na wasiwasi kuhusu chakurya na achirya, andaamulwa mana kakaamini kala rira ahendaro ni sawa mbere za Mlungu. Mana mutu yeyesi achihenda dzambo ambaro kanaro hakika, phahi naamanye kala anahenda dambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
